    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I wonder how the Endermen do it. Move so effortlessly through the void. I can't make it across my lab in the dark without smashing my shins off of a piece of furniture. I think I may have figured out a way to harness the power of Endermen to help me "
        },
        {
          "text": "see in the dark",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", as they do.\n\nWhen an "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead ",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "wizard casts the spell, the "
        },
        {
          "text": "duration is effectively permanent. ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "casting the spell again will toggle it off."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
